        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: bivalve animal food, extractants\n- Concepts: cosmetic properties, hair-growth properties\n- Chemicals: hexane, ethyl acetate, ethanol, water, methanol, dimethyl carbinol\n\nFacts:\n- A food described as outstanding for various bivalve animals is associated with cosmetic properties when extracts are made with hexane, ethyl acetate, ethanol, water, methanol, or dimethyl carbinol.\n- The same bivalve animal food is also associated with hair-growth properties when extracts are made with hexane, ethyl acetate, ethanol, water, methanol, or dimethyl carbinol.",
